  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">NTA JIPMAT Answer Key 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-10T22:11:21+05:30\">June 10, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">10:11 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://exams.nta.ac.in/JIPMAT/\">National Testing Agency (NTA)</a>&nbsp;</strong>has released&nbsp;the<strong> Answer Key&nbsp;</strong>on its <strong>official website</strong> for the <strong>Admission of the Join Integrated Program in Management Admission Test 2026.</strong> The exam was conducted from <strong data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"430\">07 June 2026</strong>. The&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"469\">NTA application process</strong>&nbsp;started on&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"498\">16 April 2026</strong>, and candidates were able to submit their Application until&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"576\">10 May 2026</strong>. Candidates can check their <b>Answer Key&nbsp;</b>using their&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"704\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>&nbsp;by logging into the<strong>&nbsp;portal.</strong>&nbsp;The&nbsp;<strong>direct link</strong>&nbsp;is provided below.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">NTA JIPMAT Answer Key 2026 – Out</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">NTA JIPMAT Examination 2026 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/nta-jipmat-admission-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <b>16 April 2026</b></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online :<b> 10 May 2026&nbsp;</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date Online Payment :&nbsp;<b>11 May 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Correction Date :<b> 12-14 May 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">JIPMAT Exam Date :&nbsp; 07 June 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam City Details :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong> 28 May 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li>