ge Limit For Any Candidates</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Check More Details For NTA JIPMAT 2026 Visit Official Website.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">NA</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">NTA JIPMAT Online Form 2026 : Admission Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 44.1211%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Exam Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 55.8789%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Education Qualification</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 44.1211%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">JIPMAT 2026 Examination</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 55.8789%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Passed 10+2 with at least 60% marks (55% for SC/ST candidates).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</sp