-start=\"469\" data-end=\"529\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"527\">“Download Exam City Detail / Admit Card 2026”</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1uunqd\" data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"575\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Your admit card will appear on the screen</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"zg36lt\" data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"601\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Download the PDF file</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"cudhwc\" data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"638\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Take a&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"636\">clear colour printout</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;NTA JIPMAT Online Form 2026 : Mode Of Selection&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>CBT Mode</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>Join Our Telegram Channel</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n<