m City Slip?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> You may need your Application Number, Date of Birth, and Security Pin/Login details.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> <strong data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"652\">What information is available in the Exam City Intimation Slip?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The slip may contain exam city name, exam date, shift timing, and important instructions.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website of <strong>NTA JIPMAT</strong>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website of <strong>NTA JIPMAT</strong> is <strong>https://exams.nta.ac.in/JIPMAT/</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-35649 aligncenter\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-05-28T111317.321-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"NTA JIPMAT Exam City Details 2026\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-05-28T111317.321-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-05-28T111317.321-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-05-28T111317.321-768x432.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-05-28T111317.321.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"></p>\n<p></p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\